cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: s2pro-native
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Löhr
    given-names: Luka
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/luka-loehr/s2pro-native
abstract: >-
  A native C and CUDA streaming runtime for Fish Audio S2-Pro text-to-speech
  on NVIDIA DGX Spark, with a Dual-AR transformer implementation, RVQ
  vocoder, FP8 block-scale GEMM integration, and a dependency-free HTTP
  streaming service.
keywords:
  - text-to-speech
  - Fish Audio S2-Pro
  - C
  - CUDA
  - streaming inference
  - FP8
  - NVIDIA DGX Spark
